  "camera": "pan_up",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari",
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "Well now, a seagull with a tiny hat and an otter with a big question. What's all this?",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 10.78
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S034b",
  "still": "E03-S034",
  "img_job": "c365bc0d-9995-4474-a0b6-ca24cc01d6e2",
  "dur": 4.54,
  "gen": 5,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari",
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Gran Mari, where does a rainbow come from?",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 3.04
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S034c",
  "still": "E03-S034",
  "img_job": "c365bc0d-9995-4474-a0b6-ca24cc01d6e2",
  "dur": 11.1,
  "gen": 12,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari",
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "Oh, that is a good question, Ollie. Let's find out together.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 9.6
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S035",
  "still": "E03-S035",
  "img_job": "51d5a700-837a-498a-a1cb-b7aec10e7dfd",
  "dur": 10.66,
  "gen": 11,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "pip",
   "gran_mari"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "Never look right at the sun, little one. We look at the wall instead.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 9.16
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S036",
  "still": "E03-S036",
  "img_job": "793c3cc7-82fd-45d5-bad0-ebb4a2c5cbcf",
  "dur": 9.81,
  "gen": 10,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari",
   "ollie",
   "pip"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "Sunlight looks plain. But it is made of every color, all mixed up together.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 8.31
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S037",
  "still": "E03-S037",
  "img_job": "cd6294c3-4c99-458c-ab91-dec492c9dda4",
  "dur": 5.29,
  "gen": 6,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "ollie",
   "gran_mari"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "A rainbow! On the wall!",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 3.79
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S037b",
  "still": "E03-S037",
  "img_job": "cd6294c3-4c99-458c-ab91-dec492c9dda4",
  "dur": 10.09,
  "gen": 11,
  "camera": "slow_push",
  "chars": [
   "ollie",
   "gran_mari"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "The water bends the light and spreads the colors apart. Tiny drops of rain work just like this glass.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 8.59
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S038",
  "still": "E03-S038",
  "img_job": "38797990-541b-4254-9832-c545d9b5c7f8",
  "dur": 7.46,
  "gen": 8,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "luna",
   "ollie",
   "pip",
   "gus",
   "gran_mari"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "So the rainbow is hiding in the sunlight?",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 2.35
   },
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "Well now, what do you think happens next?",
    "start": 3.25,
    "length": 3.21
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S038b",
  "still": "E03-S038",
  "img_job": "38797990-541b-4254-9832-c545d9b5c7f8",
  "dur": 6.53,
  "gen": 7,
  "camera": "slow_push",
  "chars": [
   "luna",
   "ollie",
   "pip",
   "gus",
   "gran_mari"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "It moves if you move the glass!",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 5.03
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S040",
  "still": "E03-S040",
  "img_job": "612bbde0-6fcf-417d-81fe-d7546e85319f",
  "dur": 6.0,
  "gen": 6,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "pip"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "pip",
    "text": "It needs the sun to shine through!",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 2.07
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S042",
  "still": "E03-S042",
  "img_job": "80335acf-80a6-49b4-8cb5-90efe7078536",
  "dur": 9.49,
  "gen": 10,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Try it at home with a grown-up! Fill a clear glass with water. Set it on a sunny windowsill.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 5.13
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S043",
  "still": "E03-S043",
  "img_job": "fcd443f5-5275-4e5d-9614-476d8a40d73a",
  "dur": 8.42,
  "gen": 9,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Look at the wall nearby. Find the rainbow! Never look right at the sun.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 6.92
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S045",
  "still": "E03-S045",
  "img_job": "5fd20721-6006-440a-be0f-5fcce3bfafe8",
  "dur": 5.72,
  "gen": 6,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "gus"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "Wait. I have to tell you something.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 4.22
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S045b",
  "still": "E03-S045",
  "img_job": "5fd20721-6006-440a-be0f-5fcce3bfafe8",
  "dur": 7.15,
  "gen": 8,
  "camera": "slow_push",
  "chars": [
   "gus"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "I said my rainbow was sleeping. That was a fib. I covered it with my hat.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 5.65
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S045c",
  "still": "E03-S045",
  "img_job": "5fd20721-6006-440a-be0f-5fcce3bfafe8",
  "dur": 5.58,
  "gen": 6,
  "camera": "slow_push",
  "chars": [
   "gus"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "I wanted it all for me, and then it was gone. I'm sorry.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 4.08
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S046",
  "still": "E03-S046",
  "img_job": "be322066-9867-4108-bbaf-1f96185e2873",
  "dur": 6.05,
  "gen": 7,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "ollie",
   "gus"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Thanks for telling us the truth, Gus.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 4.55
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E03-S049",
